@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title File activity - supporting materials
actor Teacher
participant "Native File form" as Form
participant "Picker / scoped batch" as Batch
database "Native draft / activity" as Files
Teacher -> Form : Open Settings or create File
Teacher -> Form : Import materials
Form -> Batch : Actual filemanager context and limits
Teacher -> Batch : Select files/folders; review; import
Batch -> Files : Supporting copies use sortorder = 0
Batch --> Form : Refresh original draft
note over Form, Files : Existing main-file choice remains unchanged
alt Save
 Teacher -> Form : Native Save
 Form -> Files : Core File save
else Cancel
 Teacher -> Form : Native Cancel
 note over Form, Files : Permanent resource remains unchanged
end
@enduml
